WEBVTT

00:00:10.712 --> 00:00:11.797
[growling]

00:00:15.550 --> 00:00:16.551
No!

00:00:19.221 --> 00:00:20.389
No!

00:00:25.519 --> 00:00:27.187
[roaring]

00:00:41.910 --> 00:00:43.078
We have won.

00:00:43.286 --> 00:00:46.081
Now, finish her!

00:00:46.206 --> 00:00:47.541
No!

00:00:47.624 --> 00:00:49.751
[Drago's bewilderbeast roaring]

00:00:49.835 --> 00:00:50.919
[Valka groans]

00:00:55.924 --> 00:00:57.134
[Stoick] Hold on!

00:00:57.300 --> 00:00:58.301
Skullcrusher, go!

00:00:59.428 --> 00:01:00.429
Come on, Gobber!

00:01:00.512 --> 00:01:02.722
Right behind you, Stoick!

00:01:05.434 --> 00:01:07.144
[screams] Whoa! Whoa!

00:01:11.398 --> 00:01:12.691
[screaming]

00:01:14.109 --> 00:01:15.610
[both grunt]

00:01:22.117 --> 00:01:23.160
[Hiccup] Stop!

00:01:25.287 --> 00:01:26.580
Stop!

00:01:30.750 --> 00:01:32.252
[snickering]

00:01:32.752 --> 00:01:36.673
This is the great dragon master?

00:01:36.840 --> 00:01:39.509
The son of Stoick the Vast?

00:01:40.969 --> 00:01:43.805
What shame he must feel.

00:01:45.432 --> 00:01:48.643
All of this loss, and for what?

00:01:48.852 --> 00:01:50.353
To become unstoppable?

00:01:50.854 --> 00:01:52.564
To rule the world?

00:01:53.023 --> 00:01:56.526
Dragons are kind, amazing creatures

00:01:56.693 --> 00:01:58.487
that can bring people together.

00:02:00.489 --> 00:02:02.782
Or tear them apart.

00:02:03.492 --> 00:02:04.576
[gasps]

00:02:05.285 --> 00:02:06.286
You see…

00:02:06.369 --> 00:02:10.373
I know what it is to live in fear.

00:02:10.540 --> 00:02:13.210
To see my village burned,

00:02:13.376 --> 00:02:15.712
my family taken.

00:02:16.546 --> 00:02:19.007
But even as a boy,

00:02:19.299 --> 00:02:21.384
left with nothing,

00:02:21.593 --> 00:02:25.931
I vowed to rise above the fear of dragons

00:02:27.766 --> 00:02:30.727
and liberate the people of this world.

00:02:30.894 --> 00:02:32.979
Then why a dragon army?

00:02:33.104 --> 00:02:37.526
Well, you need dragons
to conquer other dragons.

00:02:37.692 --> 00:02:41.196
Or maybe you need dragons
to conquer people.

00:02:41.404 --> 00:02:44.157
To control those who follow you,

00:02:44.574 --> 00:02:46.743
and to get rid of those who won't.

00:02:47.202 --> 00:02:48.870
[snickering]

00:02:49.287 --> 00:02:51.081
Clever boy.

00:02:51.248 --> 00:02:53.875
The world wants peace.

00:02:54.042 --> 00:02:57.170
And we have the answer back on Berk.

00:02:57.337 --> 00:02:59.381
Just let me show you.

00:02:59.464 --> 00:03:00.924
No!

00:03:01.091 --> 00:03:04.511
Let me show you!

00:03:04.719 --> 00:03:06.263
[shouting]

00:03:12.561 --> 00:03:13.645
What in…

00:03:19.109 --> 00:03:20.277
Hiccup!

00:03:21.444 --> 00:03:23.154
-[panting]
-[Stoick] Come on, Gobber!

00:03:23.238 --> 00:03:25.156
Okay, change of plan!

00:03:27.617 --> 00:03:31.079
No dragon can resist the alpha's command.

00:03:31.288 --> 00:03:35.250
So, he who controls the alpha

00:03:35.458 --> 00:03:37.961
controls them all.

00:03:41.965 --> 00:03:43.049
Toothless?

00:03:45.594 --> 00:03:47.095
[whimpers]

00:03:48.805 --> 00:03:51.099
Toothless, you okay, bud? What's going on?

00:03:51.266 --> 00:03:53.518
[Drago] Witness true strength.

00:03:54.811 --> 00:03:57.939
The strength of will over others.

00:04:03.653 --> 00:04:04.696
In the face of it,

00:04:05.614 --> 00:04:08.158
you are nothing.

00:04:13.622 --> 00:04:14.956
What did he just tell you?

00:04:15.457 --> 00:04:16.875
[panting]

00:04:18.835 --> 00:04:20.462
Toothless, come on.

00:04:21.087 --> 00:04:22.339
What's the matter with you?

00:04:22.505 --> 00:04:23.590
No, no, no, no. Come on.

00:04:23.757 --> 00:04:25.342
What are you doing? Knock it off.

00:04:25.925 --> 00:04:27.844
Stop! Snap out of it!

00:04:32.515 --> 00:04:34.017
[grunting]

00:04:35.226 --> 00:04:36.227
Toothless, no!

00:04:36.853 --> 00:04:37.937
Toothless!

00:04:41.983 --> 00:04:43.485
-[Hiccup] Don't!
-Hiccup!

00:04:44.944 --> 00:04:46.029
Stop!

00:04:46.196 --> 00:04:48.114
-Son!
-Dad!

00:04:48.281 --> 00:04:49.366
-No!
-[grunts]

00:04:50.158 --> 00:04:51.618
[gasping]

00:04:56.206 --> 00:04:57.666
Hmm.

00:04:59.501 --> 00:05:01.002
[panting]

00:05:08.468 --> 00:05:09.719
No.

00:05:13.223 --> 00:05:14.891
[grunting]

00:05:17.852 --> 00:05:19.020
Dad!

00:05:20.105 --> 00:05:21.189
Stoick!

00:05:24.818 --> 00:05:25.819
Dad.

00:05:26.361 --> 00:05:28.154
No, you…

00:05:40.834 --> 00:05:41.835
No.

00:05:51.344 --> 00:05:53.513
[Hiccup] No, no, no.

00:05:57.392 --> 00:05:58.727
[gasps]

00:06:15.618 --> 00:06:16.911
No! Get away from him!

00:06:17.454 --> 00:06:18.538
[whines]

00:06:18.788 --> 00:06:20.248
Go on! Get out of here!

00:06:20.957 --> 00:06:22.667
-[whimpers]
-[Hiccup] Get away!

00:06:24.252 --> 00:06:27.839
It's not his fault. You know that.

00:06:28.965 --> 00:06:30.049
[sighs]

00:06:30.967 --> 00:06:32.177
[roaring]

00:06:34.429 --> 00:06:35.722
[Valka] Good dragons

00:06:35.805 --> 00:06:37.932
under the control of bad people…

00:06:38.099 --> 00:06:39.142
Wait! Don't go.

00:06:39.225 --> 00:06:40.560
[Valka] …do bad things.

00:06:44.314 --> 00:06:45.815
[snickers]

00:06:52.614 --> 00:06:54.032
[grunts]

00:06:59.412 --> 00:07:00.789
[Toothless whimpers]

00:07:00.872 --> 00:07:01.915
[Drago] Come on!

00:07:03.249 --> 00:07:05.543
Gather the men and meet me at Berk!

00:07:05.710 --> 00:07:07.170
Toothless!

00:07:07.337 --> 00:07:08.922
No, don't.

00:07:09.297 --> 00:07:10.632
[men cheering]

00:07:10.715 --> 00:07:12.008
[growls]

00:07:34.489 --> 00:07:36.908
[Gobber] May the Valkyries welcome you

00:07:37.408 --> 00:07:40.703
and lead you through
Odin's great battlefield.

00:07:40.870 --> 00:07:43.790
May they sing your name with love and fury

00:07:43.873 --> 00:07:47.293
so that we might
hear it rise from the depths of Valhalla

00:07:47.794 --> 00:07:50.505
and know that you have taken
your rightful place

00:07:50.588 --> 00:07:52.841
at the table of kings.

00:07:54.509 --> 00:07:56.970
For a great man has fallen.

00:07:57.679 --> 00:08:00.849
A warrior. A chieftain.

00:08:01.432 --> 00:08:02.976
A father.

00:08:04.102 --> 00:08:05.645
A friend.

